===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|trig}}, {{m|enm|tryg}}, from {{der|en|non|tryggr||loyal, faithful, true}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*triwwiz||loyal, faithful, true}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|trīewe||faithful, loyal, true}}. More at {{l|en|true}}.

